cility maintenance services.","Jacksonville — Duval County: Full commercial janitorial, disinfection, floor care, and facility maintenance services.","West Palm Beach — Palm Beach County: Full commercial janitorial, disinfection, floor care, and facility maintenance services.","Boca Raton — Palm Beach County: Full commercial janitorial, disinfection, floor care, and facility maintenance services.","Clearwater — Pinellas County: Full commercial janitorial, disinfection, floor care, and facility maintenance services.","St. Petersburg — Pinellas County: Full commercial janitorial, disinfection, floor care, and facility maintenance services.","Davie — Broward County: Full commercial janitorial, disinfection, floor care, and facility maintenance services.","Doral — Miami-Dade County: Full commercial janitorial, disinfection, floor care, and facility maintenance services."]},{"heading":"Industries We Serve in Florida","body":"We specialize in six core verticals across Florida, each with dedicated cleaning protocols designed for its specific compliance and safety requirements.","features":["Schools & Educational Facilities: CDC-compliant cleaning for K-12 schools, charter schools, private academies, and universities.","Churches & Houses of Worship: Respectful, meticulous cleaning for sanctuaries, fellowship halls, nurseries, and administrative offices for congregations of all sizes.","Healthcare & Medical Offices: OSHA-compliant terminal cleaning for medical offices, dental practices, outpatient clinics, urgent care centers, and long-term care facilities.","Daycare & Childcare Centers: Specialized cleaning for infant rooms, toddler areas, and play spaces using exclusively non-toxic, eco-friendly products approved for environments with children.","Government & Municipal Buildings: Secure, reliable cleaning for government offices, courthouses, community centers, and public facilities.","Commercial Office Buildings: Comprehensive cleaning programs for single-tenant offices to multi-floor commercial properties including conference rooms, reception areas, and shared spaces."]}],"relatedLinks":[{"href":"/locations/florida/orlando/","label":"Cleaning Services in Orlando","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/miami/","label":"Cleaning Services in Miami","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/fort-lauderdale/","label":"Cleaning Services in Fort Lauderdale","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/kissimmee/","label":"Cleaning Services in Kissimmee","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/miami-beach/","label":"Cleaning Services in Miami Beach","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/coral-gables/","label":"Cleaning Services in Coral Gables","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/hialeah/","label":"Cleaning Services in Hialeah","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/pembroke-pines/","label":"Cleaning Services in Pembroke Pines","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/tampa/","label":"Cleaning Services in Tampa","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/jacksonville/","label":"Cleaning Services in Jacksonville","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/west-palm-beach/","label":"Cleaning Services in West Palm Beach","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/boca-raton/","label":"Cleaning Services in Boca Raton","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/clearwater/","label":"Cleaning Services in Clearwater","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/st-petersburg/","label":"Cleaning Services in St. Petersburg","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/davie/","label":"Cleaning Services in Davie","icon":"map-pin"},{"href":"/locations/florida/doral/","label":"Cleaning Services in Doral","icon":"map-pin"}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L3",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","locations","children","$4","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L5",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undef